@startuml Manager Manage Pricing
title Sequence Diagram: Quản lý Bảng giá & Pricing Engine (Task 4)
skinparam theme cerulean

actor Manager
boundary "manage-pricing.html" as UI
control "PricingController" as Ctrl
entity "PricingService" as Svc
entity "PricingEngine" as Engine
entity "SeatPriceRepository" as Repo

== Cấu hình bảng giá ==
Manager -> UI: Cập nhật đơn giá cho loại ghế/phòng
UI -> Ctrl: PUT /api/pricing (SeatPriceRequest)
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc: updateSeatPrice(request)
Svc -> Repo: save(seatPrice)
Svc --> Ctrl: 200 OK
Ctrl --> UI: Thông báo thành công
deactivate Ctrl

== Tính toán giá vé (Dành cho Booking sau này) ==
[-> Svc: calculateTicketPrice(showtime, seat)
activate Svc
Svc -> Engine: calculate(context)
activate Engine

Engine -> Engine: Apply SeatTypeStrategy (VIP/Couple surcharge)
Engine -> Engine: Apply RoomTypeStrategy (IMAX/4DX surcharge)
Engine -> Engine: Apply DateTimeStrategy (Weekend surcharge)

Engine --> Svc: Final Price
deactivate Engine
[<-- Svc: Final Price
deactivate Svc

@enduml
